+// Rewind a fast-forwarded sub-MCU to the position it would truly be at when
+// the main MCU is at `now` (in sub-MCU cycles). Called before any external
+// access to sub-MCU state; a no-op unless the clock is ahead.
+void SM_FF_Sync(submcu_t& sm, uint64_t now);
+
